WEBVTT

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:20.620
With this, It all finally comes
down to this moment, Queen!

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:27.170
I'm afraid it would seem so.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:30.670
This <i>Neighboring World</i> is
under my dominion after all.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:34.380
Despite knowing that,
you still want to destroy it?

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.310
Yes. You see! It's my right as
the dominion here, is it not?

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:43.060
Such foolishness. You don't seem
to know what you're talking about.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:47.060
You're saying the fate of this world is based on your sole whims?

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:52.610
If it's really that foolish, then our lives
on the line shares the same sentiment.

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:55.320
Very well! Are you done
twaddling here?

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:57.950
There was no point of
this conversation anyway.

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:00.200
<b>You really are...</b>

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:02.450
...a pest.
...a sacrifice.

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:05.960
Zaphkiel.

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:11.550
Lucifugus.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:24.270
Aleph.

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:25.520
Acceleration?

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:29.270
Moznaim.

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:30.320
Teleportation?

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:44.370
<i>Upon death, human souls will
ascend to Heaven or fall into Hell.</i>

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:50.340
<i>In that case, for a spirit being like myself,
what sort of place awaits my arrival?</i>

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:31.350
Looks like It's starting soon.

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:43.110
Tick Tock Tick Tock Tick Tock.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:45.410
One minute and counting!

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:49.450
She finally arrived!
The Last Participant!

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:59.420
<i>I'm sorry, I'm sorry.</i>

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.090
<i>I can no longer be
with you anymore.</i>

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:07.430
<i>My dear Love.
My miserable Death.</i>

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:10.390
<i>But...</i>

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:13.640
<i>But I believe one day,
I'll be by your side again.</i>

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.540
How lovely of you.

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.930
What could this place be?

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:50.260
"Kurumi Tokisaki's entry in the
battlefield has been confirmed!"

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:53.390
"The game will commence in 30 seconds."

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:57.560
"To our dear participants,
indulge yourselves to your heart's content."

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:58.810
Huh?

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:01.730
"Commencing the game in 20 seconds!"

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:04.950
"Enjoy yourselves to your heart's content."

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.320
"Since only one person will survive this game,"

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:10.160
"Please do your best to kill your enemies."

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.160
What is happening here?

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:16.750
Why am I...?
Where is this place?

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.170
And what's up with
killing each other?

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:25.680
The Game begins now!

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:32.720
You're getting in the way, Tsuan!

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.180
In a Battle Royale, no one's
gettting in anyone's way.

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:38.730
For now, my top priority is
to settle things out with Ayame.

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:42.360
Ayame Takeshita is currently going
head to head with Doll Master.

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:45.700
She's no match for Doll Master.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:49.070
Thus, You may not be able
to settle score with her at all.

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:53.160
Well! In that case, I just need to
defeat you and Doll Master!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:55.910
Yes, that would be a wise choice.

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:57.080
But...

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:01.790
What you're asking here
is quite impossible to happen.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:05.630
We'll never know unless
we clash, won't we? Biscuit Smasher!

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:13.890
A killing game?
No way! It's actually happening!

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:17.810
And who exactly goes there?

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.060
Yui Sagakure.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:28.110
Go on. I'll see you later.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:34.200
So I have to participate in
this <i>Killing Game</i>, right?

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:40.370
I wonder why I arrived here.
and why I am still alive.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:45.130
I wonder who you could possibly be,
and why the cat is such a cutie.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.920
You have me completely lost here.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:51.340
If you really wish to
appear as my enemy,

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:53.550
I shall faithfully oblige my role.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:54.810
Silly talk!

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:02.690
Quite an interesting move
you got there.

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:06.980
Huh?

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.900
I see. You're a ninja, right?

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:11.240
Meow?

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:14.990
Oh my, didn't I tell you
to flee from here?

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:20.870
I'm really sorry.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:24.170
Lets see,

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.420
There's one,
Lets see,

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:26.210
Two?
There's one,
Lets see,

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.130
Three more to go!
Two?
There's one,
Lets see,

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:31.130
How I really wish to end this farce quickly by killing you all. Jeez!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:35.300
For now, maybe I should amuse
myself with the weaklings.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:45.400
H-Help me, Please!

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:48.190
Help Me Ple-

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.150
Can you step aside
for a moment?

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:00.910
I did help you there but—

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.500
Are you my enemy too?

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:06.590
If so, I can give you the easy and
quick way out of this game.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.210
Not at all!
I'm not your enemy!

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:12.300
I'm begging you,
Put your gun away!

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.090
Then, let's make a deal.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:18.010
The term is "Tell me about everything
you know about this place."

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:23.310
As a newcomer, I'm still unsure
of telling right from wrong here.

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:35.240
First thing first.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:38.030
Do you have any idea
why you ended up here?

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:39.740
No, I don't.

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.620
What's your name, anyway?

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.460
My name is...

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:47.460
Kurumi Tokisaki, I'm a <i>Spirit.</i>

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:52.630
You can't be a <i>Spirit</i> if you're here.
You are a <i>Quasi-Spirit</i>, right?

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:58.260
Spirits are calamities who used to live
in this world a long time ago.

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:02.930
They have the capability to destroy worlds,
which makes them on par with Goddesses.

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:05.770
But they did leave for the
real world a while ago.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:11.150
That's why those who exist here can't be possibly <i>Spirits</i>. They must be <i>Quasi-Spirits.</i>

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.650
—Lesser spirit beings,
known as Quasi-Spirits?

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:19.120
I know it's a bit late, but
my name is Hibiki Higoromo!

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.740
Nice to meet you!

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.580
Now then, is there anything
else you want to know?

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.290
Actually, yes.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:29.710
Why does this killing game
exist in the first place?

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.000
To grant the winner's wish!

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:33.420
Wish?

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:37.300
The dominion of the Tenth Region,
<i>Malkuth</i>, ruled by a <i>Quasi-spirit</i>—

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.510
has the power
to grant our wishes!

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:40.970
Malkuth?

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:44.930
Ah, I get it. You still
don't understand, do you?

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:50.560
For starters, this isn't the same world
as the one you used to know.

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.400
This one's the <i>Neighboring World.</i>

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:56.280
Girls who are no longer human
now live in this world.

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.530
Could it be a Heaven?

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:02.030
Or it might be a Hell?

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:06.870
Kurumi! Please come over here
with me for a moment!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.330
What's up with you—

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:09.580
H-Hold up!

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:16.630
See? Now you
believe me, right?

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:23.760
I suppose you're right. After seeing this,
there is no point of being skeptical anymore.

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:25.180
Glad to hear that.

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:29.480
I'm glad I convinced you without doing anything extreme, like jumping off for example!

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:33.320
In that case, you can go ahead and be my guest for the experiment.

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:36.150
I'll patiently wait
here for your return.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:38.650
What will you do if
I don't return at all?

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:41.870
Naturally, I'd mourn
your precious sacrifice.

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:44.990
You can at least say that sincerely!

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:48.580
About the things you explained earlier—

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:51.130
Saying that winning grants any wish.

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:52.210
Yes?

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:55.750
This wish. Can It be
anything I ask for?

00:10:55.920 --> 00:11:02.550
Yes. You can revive the dead.
You can even go back to the Real World too.

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:06.100
Is it possible to go back?

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:09.390
If you can come out on top
in this killing game—

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:11.900
The right to use that
wish will belong to you!

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:21.320
A killing game with such grand prize,
who could've organized it?

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:23.240
I don't exactly know who—

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:27.490
She goes by the name <i>White Queen</i>,
But we just refer her as <i>Queen.</i>

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.210
Besides that, I don't know
what she's really like.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:31.830
Queen.

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:35.790
Um, do you think we can
team up or something?

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:38.210
Teaming up? With you?

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:42.130
Yes! I also want to use that wish
to grant me something.

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:44.220
That's why I want
to survive this game.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:47.850
I may be physically weak,
but my knowledge is reliable.

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:51.020
Altough you're still puzzled,
you're very strong.

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:53.400
I'd say we make
a good team, right?

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:58.730
Of course, we'll still have to
face each other in the end.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:02.660
At that time, I want us to
fight fair and square!

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:05.740
Please give me three seconds to decide!

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:08.790
Sure, take you tim—
Just three seconds?

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:09.620
1...

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:10.540
2...
1...

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:11.160
3...
2...
1...

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:11.660
Let's do it!
3...
2...
1...

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:12.580
So fast!

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.580
But I will never tolerate betrayers!

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:17.630
U-Understood.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:23.090
Well! Enlighten me, then. So I know whom I should point my gun at!

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:27.430
Yes! For this game now,
including Kurumi and I.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:38.110
Tsuan.

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:42.150
Out of all participants,
she's physically the strongest here.

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:45.280
"Biscuit Smasher"
is her title here.

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:47.990
"Biscuit—",
come again?

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:49.740
Biscuit Smasher.

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:52.750
Rumor says she easily crushes her enemy
like smashing a biscuit.

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:54.580
Quite unpleasant.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:58.170
Yui Sagakure,
A Female Ninja.

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:01.920
Somehow her face is often
seen in several places at once!

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:04.050
Could this be the power
of cloning technique?

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:07.010
Ah. I remember
meeting her before.

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:10.560
Now we know that she can use
clone techniques to flee.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.140
Isami Hijikata.

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:15.600
Her sword is
very long and big.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:17.860
She's really gung-ho
about cutting people down!

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.900
You lost me there.

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:23.280
I'm sorry, I was just imagining her
enthusiasm when fighting!

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:28.200
Here we have..
Ayame Takeshita, But...

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:30.620
Looks like this one
is already done for.

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:31.950
Oh dear...

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:38.290
Panie Ibusaki. We usually
call her Doll Master.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:41.460
Did you remember the
dolls that attacked me earlier?

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:43.760
She's the Quasi-Spirit
who pulls their strings.

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:49.340
Then there's nothing to worry about, right?
They're just mere puppets after all.

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:53.930
The bad news is she can control
more than 100 of these puppets.

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:56.060
She's the definition of
a "One-Girl army".

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:57.350
Is that so?

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:03.360
And the last one is
the Queen herself.

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:07.490
Does this queen also participate in her own killing game?

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:10.780
Sometimes she does,
sometimes she doesn't.

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:12.910
This time, I'm not sure
if she participates.

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.710
I think I'm getting
the picture here.

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:21.500
I need to ask you one more
question, if that's okay with you.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.380
Ask away!

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:26.420
What is it that
you really desire?

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:30.340
I want to revive my friend.

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:32.390
That is truly what I desire.

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:33.810
Friend?

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:34.850
Yes.

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:37.730
She was very precious
to me. She really was!

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:41.650
If you could revive a lost friend,

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:44.650
Putting your life on the line
would be worth it, right?

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:48.820
I guess...
You could say so.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:51.410
Let's do our best, Kurumi!

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:54.990
We'll still have to kill each
other at the very end, though.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.290
Well! We're not there yet.

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:04.000
Are you the new Quasi-Spirit?

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:05.880
I am a<i> newcomer</i>.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.010
but I'm not a <i>Quasi-Spirit!</i>

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:14.600
As a genuine Spirit, I'm telling you that
"Quasi" can't be attributed to me.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:17.720
That is... Very interesting!

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:49.420
I might be a Spirit but it just feels wrong...
that i'm almost at my limit here, right?

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:55.800
Hey, there! You are
the new participant, right?

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:59.470
Please! Don't shoot!

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:02.770
If you shoot me,
Hibiki Higoromo will die.

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:07.320
You're saying you
hold her hostage?

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:08.780
Y-E-S.

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:11.070
Hey! Wanna work
together with me?

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.950
I'm pretty sure I'd be more
helpful than that weakling.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.620
What a farce!

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:18.040
I'm sure you are very strong.

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:22.210
But, that Hibiki Higoromo
just keeps holding you back.

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:26.630
That's true. I admit Hibiki won't be able to do as much as you.

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.380
Right?!
Then why don—

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:32.510
Then let me ask you this,
what kind of wish do you want?

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:36.640
I wish for big sweets
and desserts.

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:40.470
And to have fun times with
all the people I turned into dolls.

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:43.060
That sounds lovely!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:44.140
I know, right?

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:52.690
But I already made a promise with her,
and I don’t intend to break it.

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:56.240
Is that so?

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:57.530
Well then,

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:58.830
Just die!

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.580
Oh my! What a harsh reply!

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:08.960
That's an appropriate response, coming from a child.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.420
What are you getting at?

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:14.260
Then, what is it that
you really wish for?

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:19.430
<i>I... I have already died once.</i>

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:23.270
<i>After dying, I found
myself in this world.</i>

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:28.400
<i>To keep my promise,
to make my wish comes true—</i>

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.980
<i>I've made a decision.</i>

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:40.410
<i>Yes. Even if it costs me...
one death or even two deaths.</i>

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:49.000
<i>I'm willing to die over and over again,
as long as I can get his love.</i>

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:53.510
<i>I'll never give up.</i>

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:58.590
<i>I wish to see him once again!</i>

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:08.770
What a scary aura!

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:13.690
Zaphkiel.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:15.360
A giant clock...

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:18.280
It can't be!
No way!

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:26.080
Allow me to introduce myself again.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.500
My name is Kurumi Tokisaki.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:31.500
I am a genuine <i>Spirit.</i>

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:38.090
With this <i>Zaphkiel</i>, I can finally deliver my proper introduction to you.

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:41.510
No way...
It can't be real...

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:44.350
This power is the real deal...

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:50.060
The worst and most frightening calamity.
The third <i>Spirit</i> who governs Time and Shadow!

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:54.110
The one and only.
Now, Doll Master!

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:56.820
Let us now play to our hearts' content!

00:18:57.990 --> 00:18:59.610
Come on!
Bring it on!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.570
You must be lying about being a <i>Spirit!</i>

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:03.530
And I'm the one
who will prove it!

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.460
Aleph.

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:15.420
You!

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:16.300
Damn You!

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:19.420
You're not a <i>Spirit!</i>
A person like you…

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:25.560
Zayin.

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:27.720
She's not here?!

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:33.020
How could sh—?

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:35.520
Oh my, cat got your tongue?

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:40.570
All I did was just walk
behind you and stand here.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:46.160
However it only happened when
I froze your time for a while.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:53.750
That can't be! No way! So you really are
the same as Queen? A <i>Spirit</i>?

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.590
The same as Queen?

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:57.130
So you're here!

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:02.760
Let us continue our fight.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.390
Hey, wait a second!

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:09.720
Do you mind if I join
this fight?

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.890
Where is Doll Master?!

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:19.440
Oh my, this is quite
a development.

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:23.740
You just made it easy
for me kill you all here.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:31.120
<i>What should I do? </i>

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.870
<i>I didn't expect any of this!</i>

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:36.710
<i>I'll just have to use Hibiki Higoromo as a scapegoat to save myself.</i>

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:39.710
<i>But why did her powers
suddenly spike like that?</i>

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:42.760
The answer to that
is quite simple.

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:46.390
In Neighboring World,
Spirit Mana can easily be called upon.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:51.430
So as long as she concentrates,
she can use <i>Zaphkiel</i> without constraints.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:01.690
It can't be.

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:04.820
I find it hard to believe as well.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:08.950
That promise she made
to a human she recently met—

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:11.910
She seems to be holding onto it.

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:18.540
But that's exactly who Kurumi really is.

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:23.670
Queen?
Why?

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:25.840
You said you wouldn’t
participate this time?

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:31.220
Thank you, Doll Master, for
helping me just the way I want it.

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:36.100
Because of your foolishness,
she finally summoned <i>Zaphkiel</i> again.

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:39.770
That was really important.
Especially for me!

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:40.860
Damn You!

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:01.290
<i>Kurumi.</i>

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:06.590
<i>As always you're refined,
perfect and menacingly mad!</i>
